# Copy to .env (gitignored); the Makefile reads it for the hetzner-* targets.
# Hetzner Cloud API token with read/write access to the project holding vm-k3s and ez-lab.de.
# Plain KEY=value: no quotes, no spaces (Make keeps them as part of the value).
HCLOUD_TOKEN=
# NetBird PAT (service user with admin role) for the hetzner/netbird stage. Created in the self-hosted
# dashboard after the first `make hetzner-up`; leave empty until then.
NB_PAT=
